WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Explore workspaces, routes, resources and My Trips.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:10.000
Choose where to start. Six cities and day trips organized in one
place.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.800
See the whole overview. Scroll through every city, day trip and
trip-wide essential.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:25.600
Browse the complete day. Times, activities and details stay together
in one continuous view.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:31.400
Open only what you need. Read directions and context while keeping
your day in view.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:37.900
Google Maps or Waze. Choose endpoints, review the order and open
your map app.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:46.900
Tickets, tours and mobility. Explore a fuller view of the options
selected around your itinerary.

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:54.500
Every destination has a workspace. Segovia, Toledo, Montserrat and
Girona keep their own context.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:01:01.700
Come back whenever you like. Reopen your trip and download the PDF
or Excel again.

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:06.500
Your trip is ready to experience.

